		{"id":"g-23cae583fd75c7","x":720,"y":0,"width":1200,"height":189,"type":"text","text":"# Stale\nWhat no longer matches the graph. Run `bash .claude/scripts/khora-stale`, then read below.\n\nColours: red = needs a person now · orange = header and Reading · yellow = live · purple = Spec, kinds and processes.\n\nRendered 2026-11-17 by agent:claude-opus-5-5","color":"2"},
