		{"id":"g-f54f024589d569","type":"group","label":"Rules","x":1680,"y":309,"width":600,"height":486},
		{"id":"g-858c92e0665b7d","x":1720,"y":379,"width":520,"height":376,"type":"text","text":"**Stale when**\n- **Sentence:** its `d:` marker names a Decision that is superseded, reversed or unknown.\n- **Document:** an Area it names has active Decisions newer than the document, none of them traced in it.\n- **Transcript:** no Call links it.\n- **Dashboard:** rendered before the newest change to a kind its Spec lists.\n- **Issue:** open, and names a superseded or reversed Decision.\n- **Question:** a `q:` row whose Question an active Decision answers.\n- **Proposal:** an `ingestion` pull request opened before the latest Team Weekly.\n"},
		{"id":"spec","type":"text","x":0,"y":0,"width":560,"height":448,"color":"6","text":"## Spec · Stale\n*Edit this card to change what the canvas shows. Agents re-render everything else from it via [[Render Canvas v1.0.0]].*\n\n**Purpose.** What in the vault no longer matches the graph it depends on (kit d17), computed by `bash .claude/scripts/khora-stale`, never judged.\n\n**Show:** the report `dashboards/stale.md` as a file card, so it is current whenever the script was last run; and a legend of the rules. No Reading card: the report speaks for itself.\n\n**Note:** `dashboards/stale.md` is not in git. Each person runs the script on their own machine before reading this canvas.\n\n**Triggers:** the script runs at every Team Weekly's Observe and after each merge. This canvas only needs re-rendering when its Spec changes.\n"}
